== [    BASIC ] ============================================================================================
   MNEMONIC: tilemovrow [ENC: EVEX, MAP: 0F3A, OPC: 0x07]
     LENGTH:  7
        SSZ: 64
       EOSZ: 32
       EASZ: 64
   CATEGORY: AMX_TILE
    ISA-SET: AMX_AVX512
    ISA-EXT: AMX_TILE
 EXCEPTIONS: AMXE7_EVEX
 ATTRIBUTES: HAS_MODRM HAS_EVEX 
  OPTIMIZED: 62 63 7D 48 07 E5 0E 

